      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, u can't find tracking?? that's weird. i'm looking at the port manifests right now and it says there's a clerical error holding up the electronics at the dock. this is bad... if the client finds out it's stuck at the port they're gonna trigger that $50k penalty clause in the contract. is there any way we can phrase the update so they don't freak out about the port issue? something that sounds like it's still moving?",
